    questionRef: '2024 HL · Paper 1 Q3(c) · Differentiation (curve & line graph)',
    stem: 'The diagram above shows the curve y = p(x) and the line y = l(x). Use the information in the diagram to estimate the two values of x for which p′(x) = l′(x).',
