    source: 'Marking scheme 2025 HL, Section A Compréhension Écrite 1 Q5(b) (‘Pour communiquer leur / la joie’ = 5 Marks; full ‘Les scouts font la vaisselle…’ sentence = 0 Marks; ‘Appropriate direct quotation OR correct manipulation acceptable’); cf. Q4(b) ‘Correct manipulation required’ and front-matter Penalties point 2',
    marks: 5,
