    subjectId: 'economics', subjectLabel: 'Economics', level: 'higher',
    questionRef: '2022 HL Section A, Q1(a)',
    stem: 'Using an appropriate formula, calculate the price elasticity of demand depicted in the graph below where the original price of the packet of face masks is €4 and then increases to €5. Show all calculations.',
