    stem: 'Interpretation of Accounts — Dunphy Ltd, year ended 31/12/2024. From the Balance Sheet: Current Assets €186,000 (including closing stock of €112,700), and Trade creditors (current liabilities) €67,000. Calculate the acid test ratio for 2024 (to 2 decimal places).',
