    trap: 'Part (a) carries 6 marks and the scheme awards High (5-6) only for thorough, accurate visual-art terminology tied to composition, motif AND colour. Describing the wall as \'colourful and detailed\' with no named principle or pattern, or covering only one or two headings, drops you to Low/Moderate — the marks are in specific, supported description, not impression.',
