    trap: 'With only colour and style splitting 5 marks, a thin answer leaks marks fast. Saying it is \'a realistic portrait in nice colours\' uses no art vocabulary and gives no evidence — that is the 0-1 Low band. The scheme\'s High band (4-5) needs accurate terminology applied to BOTH headings, so neglecting \'style\' or staying impressionistic caps you at Moderate.',
