    trap: 'You must answer under exactly two headings and develop both — naming one and then drifting, or saying the piece is \'pretty and well-made\' with no element-based detail, sits in the Low band. Part (a) is 6 marks and the High band (5-6) needs accurate use of the chosen art elements with evidence from this specific embroidery, not a general comment on sewing.',
