    trap: 'Narrating \'they are nice decorative vases\' or describing the objects in plain language with no element/principle terms, or naming principles that don\'t fit a ceramic form. The (a) mark is 6 only and is awarded for \'Discussion of the artworks illustrated using relevant art elements and design principles\'; a non-analytical, non-terminological answer is capped in the Low band (0-2).',
    source: 'LC Art (Visual Studies) 2025 HL marking scheme, Section A, Q6(a) ("Discussion of the artworks illustrated using relevant art elements and design principles" — 6 marks, Low 0-2 / Mod 3-4 / High 5-6)',
