    trap: 'Stating advantages as a bare list or an opinion with no supporting reason caps you at Low/Moderate (0-3 of 4). The scheme awards \'Discussion of the advantages of creating an edition. Justification for the answer given.\' — the High band (4) needs the reasons, so an unjustified answer loses the top mark.',
    source: 'LC Art (Visual Studies) 2024 HL marking scheme, Section A, Q2(b) ("Discussion of the advantages of creating an edition. Justification for the answer given." — 4 marks, High band 4)',
