    questionRef: '2025 HL · Section A · Q7(a)',
    stem: 'Car A, a Mini Cooper from 1996 and Car B, a Mini Cooper from 2022, are illustrated on the accompanying sheet. Compare Car A with Car B using the following headings: shape, style, details.',
