    demand: 'Treat the two cars side by side on the SAME three headings — shape, style, details — drawing each point as a contrast between Car A and Car B (e.g. softer rounded silhouette vs sharper modern profile; retro vs contemporary styling; chrome trim/round headlamps vs reworked detailing). Use design/visual terminology and cite specific visual evidence from each plate, not generic praise.',
