    stem: 'Modernism (c.1900 – 1960s). Discuss the development of one of the following: Fauvism, Expressionism, Cubism, Bauhaus, Surrealism. Refer in your answer to named artists and their artworks. Include discussion of context, innovation and invention, art elements and design principles, media and techniques.',
