    trap: 'Vague contrasts (\'Bellman is more general\', \'they work differently\') or describing what each method does without naming an actual difference earn nothing — the 5 marks sit on one specific, correct distinction with no partial-credit ladder. The question itself is the hint: part (i) MAXIMISED profit over a table containing negative weights, exactly where Dijkstra breaks down.',
