    stem: 'Andrea wants to mathematically model the optimal route for a road trip visiting five cities (Cork, Dublin, Galway, Limerick and Waterford). She researches the travel time in minutes between each pair of cities on Google Maps on a Sunday morning at 8 a.m., draws a weighted network from the times, and finds its minimum spanning tree to minimise her travelling time. Explain a limitation to Andrea\'s model.',
