    questionRef: '2024 HL Q2(a)(i)',
    stem: 'A jeep of mass 2375 kg pulls a trailer of mass 350 kg up a hill inclined at angle θ. The jeep and trailer move at a constant speed. The engine of the jeep exerts a force of 4400 N up the hill. The forces due to friction on the jeep and the trailer are 1525 N and 375 N respectively. Draw a diagram to show the forces acting on the jeep.',
