    trap: 'This is a 10-mark scale item: under the SEC scale, one systemic error drops you to 7/10 and two drop you to 4/10. The classic single error here is omitting the coupling tension T (the jeep is towing, so the trailer pulls back on it); adding the trailer\'s 375 N friction to the jeep\'s diagram counts as an extra force. A wrong force picture also tends to corrupt the slope equation in part (ii), where the scheme\'s resolution 4400 = 2725g sin θ + 1525 + 375 gives θ = 5.37°.',
