    subjectId: 'politics-and-society', subjectLabel: 'Politics & Society', level: 'ordinary',
    questionRef: '2025 OL · Section B · Q3(b)',
    stem: 'Document B (Action Against Hunger \'Hunger Hotspots\') presents Haiti, South Sudan and Sudan in a table of population, people in need, people helped and children at risk of acute malnutrition. Describe one positive about how the data is presented in Document B.',
