    trap: 'Slipping out of speech genre into a third-person \'Timon is loyal because...\' essay or just retelling the plot of the extract: the scheme rewards \'a sense of appropriate register for a speech\', so a piece with no audience address and no spoken-ceremony tone drops from the \'convincing register\' band to \'poor sense of register\' — capping an answer worth 20 marks.',
    source: 'SEC JC English 2024 HL marking scheme, Section A, Q2 ("Expect candidates to write a speech, highlighting the qualities of Timon... Reward a sense of appropriate register for a speech. Reward clarity of expression, focus and development")',
    marks: 20,
