    trap: 'Defining the term in the abstract (\'enjambment is when a line runs on\') instead of locating it in the poem, or addressing only one or two of the three terms — drops the missing term\'s full 5 marks and caps the rest, since the scheme expects all three identified and given approximately equal discussion.',
